# The raw historical schema blobs are exact byte-for-byte extractions from Git
# history. They MUST NOT be normalized (CRLF/LF or otherwise) or their pinned
# SHA-256 digests -- the authority the deep verifier rejects over the wrong
# catalog -- would no longer match. Treat them as opaque bytes.
blobs/*.sql -text
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
